<h1>sorted list</h1>
<p>
(data structure)
</p>

<p>
<strong>Definition:</strong>
A <a href="list.html"><em>list</em></a> whose items are kept sorted.
</p>

<p>
<strong>See also</strong>
<a href="sortedarray.html"><em>sorted array</em></a>, <a href="orderedLinkedList.html"><em>ordered linked list</em></a>.
</p>

<p>
<em>Note:
Often the term "sorted list" is short for "ordered linked list".</em>
</p>

<p>Author: <a href="../Other/contrib.html#authorPEB">PEB</a></p>
<h2>Implementation</h2>
<a href="https://users.dcc.uchile.cl/~rbaeza/handbook/algs/5/511.ins.c" target="_blank">insertion (C)</a> into an ordered linked list.

<hr>

